          "body": "CREDITS\nCREATED BY\nANDREW COLLAS\nADDITIONAL CONTENT BY\nREMY LEE\nEDITED BY\nREMY LEE\nART BY\nJacob Blackmon, Muzammil Ahmed\nPROOFREAD BY\nColin Bell, Derek Stark, Phillip Doty, Remy Lee, Shane Taylor,\nTownsend Amponsah,\nPLAYTESTED BY\nAnn Erdserd, April Dawn Duncan, Colin Bell, Danielle Rene Pecor,\nDavid Collins, Derek Stark, James Kerr, Janet Lynn, Jason Harris,\nJessica Florence, Paul Bachleda, Remy Lee, Oneal Flynn, Ryan\nCarlson, Sgt. Dan Krenzke, Walter McCulloch,"
