          "body": "EDGE\nEdge is HEROIC 5e’s heroic currency. It represents dramatic\nmomentum, effort, luck, determination, and comic-book timing.\nEdge is not Power Points. It does not fuel Powers directly.\nSTARTING EDGE\nCAMPAIGN RANK PER SESSION\nStreet Level 3\nMid-Level 2\nWorld Class 1\nEdge Cap: Level + Prowess. Edge refreshes to the\nstarting amount at the beginning of each session,\nnot to the cap.\nWHEN TO SPEND EDGE\nUnless a rule says otherwise, Edge may be spent after seeing the\nroll but before the GM describes the final outcome. Only one Edge\nmay be spent on the same roll or immediate effect unless a\nspecific rule permits otherwise."
